0..78 Comment "// A function row\'s precondition chosen through the layout program, refused by"
79..94 Comment "// the checker."
95..97 Comment "//"
98..170 Comment "// `Option<&u32>`\'s realisers are picked by whether its layout keeps the"
171..243 Comment "// discriminant in a niche. The program runs to the niche, so the row is"
244..265 Comment "// admitted by a run."
266..268 Comment "//"
269..337 Comment "// The normaliser holds a native integer operation as a neutral, the"
338..417 Comment "// `native-primitives` row. So `niched(optRef)` does not convert to `true`, and"
418..458 Comment "// the chosen predicate does not unfold."
459..461 Comment "//"
462..534 Comment "// - see: #2901 — not implemented: the check-time refusal of an extern"
535..551 Comment "//   declaration"
552..633 Comment "// - see: `model/interop/boundary/function-row.gandr` — `optRefNiched`, the run"
634..651 Comment "//   to the niche"
653..662 Comment "// `Nat`."
